Problems Spring Boot Jdbc

1. Manual SQL
2. manual Row Mapping
3. No automatic relationship mapping
4. No Entity Lifecycle management
5. no first or second level cahce
6, dynamic queries become complex
7. pagination sorting need sql
8. Database specific sql
9. dev productivity is lower



JPA- Java Persistence API.

-> Hibernate
-> Open Jpa
-> Eclipse Link
-> My Batis

why JPA/Hibernate

1. ORM automatic
2. Auto RelationManagement
3. Caching
4. JPQL support
5. Pagination Sorting
6. TransactionManagement
7. Entity life cycle management
8. Reduced boiler plate and basic SQLs
9. JPA query methods.


caching in jpa
--------------

What is level 1 cache?
built into hibernate by default
no config
scoped into a single session/persistance context
active within the same transaction
stores entities loaded in the current session.




